    "lawCode": "Amd §1282, V & T L (as proposed in S.5294-A & A.7431-B)",
    "lawSection": "Vehicle and Traffic Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S6597\n\nSPONSOR: RAMOS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the vehicle and traffic law, in\nrelation to making technical corrections to provisions relating to bicy-\ncles with electric assist and electric scooters\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo make a clarifying amendment to the electric bicycles and electric\nscooters law.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nThis legislation makes a technical amendment.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation reflects the intent of the original electric\nscooter/bicycle authorization.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nIn the same manner as S.5294-A and A.7431-B of 2019.\n",
